      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "A menu holds actions on one thing. It\nopens from the ⋯ button, next to it; on\ndesktop a right-click opens it too. On the\nweb, right-click keeps the browser's own\nmenu (open in a new tab, copy the link). ↑\nand ↓ move through it, Esc closes it.",
      "originalText": "A menu holds actions on one thing. It\nopens from the ⋯ button, next to it; on\ndesktop a right-click opens it too. On the\nweb, right-click keeps the browser's own\nmenu (open in a new tab, copy the link). ↑\nand ↓ move through it, Esc closes it.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
