      "text": "The poster menu (LIST-2): Add to Watch\nlater; Add to your last used list, by name,\nwhen it isn't Watch later; Add to list… for\nevery list and New list. Opening the title is\na click on the poster, so it isn't in the menu.",
      "originalText": "The poster menu (LIST-2): Add to Watch\nlater; Add to your last used list, by name,\nwhen it isn't Watch later; Add to list… for\nevery list and New list. Opening the title is\na click on the poster, so it isn't in the menu.",
